* CScript escape-hatch chapter, "Checkpoint and resume": gain.c exports none of the checkpoint
* state symbols. This deck runs normally without --checkpoint-out (see example.cir, the same
* netlist); with --checkpoint-out it is refused at the first snapshot with
* CheckpointUnsupportedBlock naming G1, and no checkpoint file is written.
SRC kind=const value=3
G1 kind=cscript lib=doc-verify/cscript/gain.so in=SRC
